						 <p>I'm not supposed to reply or comment after a deletion vote is called but this is important.</p> <p>1, you're supposed to get critique before posting.</p> <p>2, there's just very little here. The dialogue is clunky and the story you have is very short and boring. You should choose a specific thing to write a narrative around. Who is that doctor? What does Manitoba have to do with the SCP? How do they communicate? These are all possible narratives you could focus on.</p> <p>3. There's numerous formatting errors.</p> 
